---
import ChickuboInfoLayout from '@/layouts/ChickuboInfoLayout.astro';
---

<ChickuboInfoLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Chickubo handles local farm saves, support messages, store services, and visits to these help pages." icon="🔒" updated>
  <div class="highlight-box">
    <p>Chickubo saves your farm and preferences on your device. The current version has no online account, iCloud synchronization, advertising SDK, or analytics SDK. Paid checkout and RevenueCat are not enabled.</p>
  </div>
  <section>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>NekoCode develops Chickubo: Cozy Chicken Farm. This policy covers the game, information you send to Chickubo support, and the Chickubo help and policy pages on nekocode.dev. For privacy questions or requests, contact <a href="mailto:nekocode.dev@gmail.com?subject=Chickubo%20Privacy">nekocode.dev@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Information kept on your device</h2>
    <p>Your local save contains your chickens, breeds, eggs, coins and gems, inventory, housing, upgrades, crops, workshop progress, feed and water, production timers, and offline-progress timestamps. It also contains tutorial progress, pending rewards, preferences, and purchase-delivery records where applicable.</p>
    <p>Chickubo uses this information to load your farm, calculate production, remember settings, and prevent duplicate rewards. The game keeps local backup and recovery copies to protect saves. It does not upload your farm to a NekoCode server or synchronize it through iCloud.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Store services and purchases</h2>
    <p>Paid checkout and online account sign-in are not available in the current version. A platform store component, if installed, may contact Apple to retrieve product information. Apple handles its own store and account information under the <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apple Privacy Policy</a>. NekoCode does not receive your payment card number.</p>
    <p>RevenueCat is not integrated in this version. Before enabling an online account, purchase verification, or RevenueCat, we will update this policy and the App Store privacy disclosures to describe the actual information collected, purposes, providers, retention, and deletion controls. Any RevenueCat processing of player purchase data would be on NekoCode's behalf, rather than an independent use of that data.</p>
    <p>An online purchase service does not by itself provide cloud backup or synchronization of your farm.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Support messages</h2>
    <p>If you email support, we receive your email address, message, and any device information, screenshots, or purchase references you choose to send. We use them to respond, investigate the issue, and handle related follow-up. Our email provider also processes the message to deliver and store correspondence. Do not send passwords, sign-in tokens, or payment card details.</p>
    <p>Support correspondence is kept for as long as needed to handle the request, investigate recurring issues, and meet applicable obligations. You can request access, correction, or deletion at <a href="mailto:nekocode.dev@gmail.com?subject=Chickubo%20Privacy%20Request">nekocode.dev@gmail.com</a>. We may need information to verify the request and may retain information where required by law.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>These website pages</h2>
    <p>Visiting the Chickubo help or policy pages sends ordinary web-request information, such as your IP address and browser information, to the website's hosting and delivery providers. The site is published through GitHub Pages; see <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a> for its processing and retention practices.</p>
    <p>Earlier versions of these pages included a visitor counter that used browser storage and sent a hash derived from browser and device attributes to a Google Apps Script service. That counter has been removed from Chickubo pages. Previously stored browser keys may remain until you clear this site's browser storage; clearing website storage does not erase a farm saved in the game. Contact us about access or deletion of previously submitted visitor-counter information. Other NekoCode pages and external sites may have their own data practices.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Sharing, security, and permissions</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information or use the current game for advertising tracking. Information you send to support is handled by providers needed to deliver that service, or disclosed when required by law. Providers acting on our behalf must protect the information consistently with this policy. We use reasonable safeguards, but no storage or transmission method is guaranteed completely secure.</p>
    <p>Core gameplay does not need access to your location, contacts, camera, or microphone. The Notifications preference controls in-game notices. Opening an external link uses your browser or another app, and the destination's privacy practices apply.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Your choices and local deletion</h2>
    <p>You control the game data on your device. Removing the app or clearing its app data may remove the save and local recovery copies. Device or operating-system backups are controlled by your platform settings. A gameplay reset is not a full deletion: purchase-delivery records, purchase-account binding, and once-only offer state may be retained to prevent duplicate rewards.</p>
    <p>NekoCode cannot remotely erase or recover your local farm. Removing local data does not delete support messages or records held by Apple, your email provider, or website hosts. Contact us separately about information we hold. Depending on your location, you may also have rights to restrict or object to processing, obtain a copy of your information, or complain to a data-protection authority.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Children and family devices</h2>
    <p>The game has no online chat or public player profiles. Parents or guardians should supervise any information a child sends to support and any purchases if they become available. If you believe a child has sent personal information that should be removed, email us with enough detail to locate it.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>We will revise this policy and its date when the game's data practices change. Privacy questions and requests can be sent to <a href="mailto:nekocode.dev@gmail.com?subject=Chickubo%20Privacy">nekocode.dev@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</ChickuboInfoLayout>
